1654 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (These substances react with water or steam to produce flammable or explosive gases and evolve heat, example concentrated acids like sulphuric acid, glacial ethanoic acid etc. Conc. Alkali like sodium hydroxide react with water later to evolve heat. Such materials must not be stored in areas where water flooding from pipe leakages or leaky roofs can happen.)
/K [11]
/Pg 1246 0 R
>>
