>>
endobj
1691 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Tanks should have a dedicated emergency drainage system to transfer contents to a safe location during incidents such as fire or structural failure. A double isolation valve system \(gate and globe valve in series\) is recommended on drain lines.)
/K [13]
/Pg 1247 0 R
>>
