/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Cylinders should be adequately protected from temperature variations and stored in a cool, dry, well-ventilated, and covered area. They must be kept away from steam pipes, furnaces, boilers, or any other heat sources. Cylinders should not be placed near gangways or elevators to prevent impact from hard objects.)
