1865 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (a\) Manual handling of drums / containers should be minimized. It is preferable fork-lifters and suitable cradles are used to handle drums.)
/K [3]
/Pg 1252 0 R
>>
endobj
1866 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (b\) Carboys containing hazardous chemicals should not be subjected to impact.)
/K [4]
/Pg 1252 0 R
>>
endobj
1867 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (c\) Suitable protective clothing should be used while handling drums / containers and the operators should position himself such that he is in the upwind direction so that even in case of accidental release of chemical, he is safe.)
/K [5]
/Pg 1252 0 R
>>
endobj
