/Pg 1261 0 R
>>
endobj
2644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.2.1 Most of the chemicals could be regarded as hazardous and could be explosive, corrosive, flammable or a poison under certain circumstances. )
/K [4]
/Pg 1261 0 R
>>
endobj
