2648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.2.3 Chemicals should only be used when the drums, sacks, containers or pipelines containing them are clearly labelled and their identity confirmed. In case of doubt, or when a mix-up has actually occurred, inform supervisor immediately.)
/K [8]
/Pg 1261 0 R
>>
endobj
2649 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.2.4 Avoid spillage of chemicals by careful handling. Keep suitable materials to chemically treat spillage, or physically containing if necessary. )
/K [9]
/Pg 1261 0 R
>>
endobj
2650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.2.5 Ensure that the clips/clamps are properly fixed while transferring chemicals through rubber, PVC or teflon hoses. )
/K [10]
/Pg 1261 0 R
>>
endobj
