/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.3.6 Compressed gas cylinders, when standing upright, should always be properly supported. Never connect a gas cylinder directly to the apparatus, always interpose a system of traps. Always turn off a gas cylinder at the main valve after use and release any excess pressure in the regulator. )
/K [8]
/Pg 1263 0 R
>>
